WEBVTT

00:10:29.056 --> 00:10:30.750
he had hiked Mt. Fuji,

00:10:30.774 --> 00:10:32.680
he had walked along the Great Wall.

00:10:32.704 --> 00:10:33.855
He likes to travel

00:10:33.879 --> 00:10:36.005
as long as it doesn't involve
a cruise ship.

00:10:36.029 --> 00:10:37.542
And I thought,

00:10:37.566 --> 00:10:38.717
I've done it!

00:10:38.741 --> 00:10:40.276
I've cracked the code.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:44.363
I have just found
the Jewish Prince Charming

00:10:44.387 --> 00:10:45.959
of my family's dreams.

00:10:46.736 --> 00:10:48.105
There was only one problem:

00:10:49.685 --> 00:10:50.986
He didn't like me back.

00:10:51.887 --> 00:10:54.949
And I guess the one variable
that I haven't considered

00:10:54.973 --> 00:10:56.383
is the competition.

00:10:56.866 --> 00:10:59.743
Who are all of the other women
on these dating sites?